# React

- Functional components only.
- Server Components by default; add `"use client"` only when required (events, browser APIs, RHF, client-only libraries).
- No duplicated business logic in components.
- Keep components presentational; call server actions / hooks for data.
- Prefer composition over inheritance.
- Accessibility: labels, focus, keyboard support for counter flows.
